</section><section data-mw-section-id="20" id="mwBcE" aria-labelledby="List_of_former_group_chief_executives"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="List_of_former_group_chief_executives">List of former group chief executives</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Barclays&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20" title="Edit section: List of former group chief executives"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBcI"><i id="mwBcM">The position of group chief executive was formed in 1992; prior to that, the group chairman held executive authority over the group.<sup about="#mwt647" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:1_194-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:1-194" id="mwBcQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBcU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBcY">[</span>194<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBcc">]</span></span></a></sup></i></p>

<ul id="mwBcg"><li id="mwBck"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Buxton" title="Andrew Buxton" id="mwBco">Andrew Buxton</a> (1992–1993)</li>
